## 🌸 About Mila

**Mila** is a modern cosmetics e-commerce website designed around a clean, minimal and elegant shopping experience.

The website allows users to explore beauty products across multiple categories, view detailed product information, add products to a shopping cart, manage quantities and automatically calculate the total order amount.

The project focuses on combining **aesthetic frontend design with practical e-commerce functionality**.

---

## ✨ Features

### 🏠 Home Page

- Mila brand landing page
- Animated splash screen
- Hero banner
- "Shop Now" navigation
- Top Categories section
- Direct category navigation
- Responsive navigation bar

### 🛍️ Shop

Users can browse the complete Mila product collection.

Products are organized into:

- Makeup
- Skincare
- Hair
- Fragrance
- Body Care
- Lips

The Shop page supports:

- Displaying all products
- Category-based filtering
- Product cards
- Product images
- Product names
- Product categories
- Product prices
- Add to Cart functionality
- Navigation to individual product pages

### 💄 Product Details

Every product has an individual product page.

Each page contains:

- Product image
- Product name
- Category
- Price
- Product description
- Quantity controls
- Add to Cart button

Users can access a product directly from the Shop page.

### 🛒 Shopping Cart

Mila includes a functional shopping cart.

Users can:

- Add products
- Add the same product multiple times
- Increase quantity
- Decrease quantity
- Remove products
- View product images
- View product prices
- View item subtotals
- View total cart quantity
- View cart subtotal
- View final total

The cart also displays an empty-cart state when no products have been added.

### 💾 Persistent Cart

The shopping cart uses **Browser Local Storage**.

This allows cart information to remain available while navigating between different pages.

